{
  "analysis": "The SKILL.md output was truncated. I can see the framework: 10 indicators in 3 tiers (A, B, C), composite risk rules based on tier triggers, and the industrial-revolution lens guidance. I need to see the complete SKILL.md and the thresholds file.",
  "plan": "Read the full SKILL.md using head/tail or less, and get the complete thresholds file and input.json.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "head -100 skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
