{
  "analysis": "The output is still truncated. I need to see the complete files. Let me use wc and cat with different approaches to get the full content.",
  "plan": "Use wc to see file sizes, then cat the thresholds file completely, and use python to read and display the full input.json and SKILL.md files.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "wc -l skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
